            "m_MenuTextQuestDesc": "[The note appears hastily written]\n\n[This section is circled several times]\n\nIn case I haven't returned: \n\n- I'm planning to make my way through the sewer tunnels to that back entrance of the Mall (the one we discovered a few weeks ago).\n- I'm damned sure there are some fuses in there somewhere... I promise this will be worth it.\n\n[End of the circled section]\n\nOli, if you're reading this it means that I haven't made it back. I can't explain why I did what I did, just that it would be worth it. Please don't follow me... but I know you will, so please be careful. ",
            "m_MenuTextQuestName": "Note #1"
          }
        },
        {
          "Class": "CEntity",
          "PrefabFieldsNative": {
            "m_EntityComponentsExtents": [69, [0.0000109, 0.0153799, 0.0000261, 0.1600108, 0.0145719, 0.1100261]],
            "m_Name": [12, "rs_pw_city_note_end"],
            "m_PcId": [6, 68],
            "m_PrefabName": [12, "quest_object_withbrief"],
            "m_Rotate": [14, [-0.0, 0.0, -90.0]],
            "m_Translate": [14, [156.0309295, 113.1515197, 97.4493026]]
          },
          "Fields": {
            "MeshName": "prp_office_notebook_a.msh",
            "m_MenuTextQuestDesc": "So there you have it... I hope you like it. A little bit of joy in a world of darkness.",
            "m_MenuTextQuestName": "Note #3"
          }
        },
        {
          "Class": "CEntity",
          "PrefabFieldsNative": {
            "m_EntityComponentsExtents": [69, [0.0000109, 0.0153799, 0.0000261, 0.1600109, 0.0145719, 0.1100261]],
            "m_Name": [12, "rs_pw_city_note_mall"],
            "m_PcId": [6, 69],
            "m_PrefabName": [12, "quest_object_withbrief"],
            "m_Rotate": [14, [-0.0, 39.5000076, -0.0]],
            "m_Translate": [14, [181.7036285, 5.7599778, -0.4118041]]
          },
          "Fields": {
            "MeshName": "prp_office_notebook_a.msh",
            "m_MenuTextQuestDesc": "[The note is smeared in blood and each letter is written erratically]\n\nI found the fuses... but they found me first. \n\n- There's one in the room next door, but I blocked the way, you'll need to gain access through a vent on the other side of the building.\n- The other is downstairs in a small fashion shop.\n\nThis place is crawling with them...\n\nListen, I mean read... whatever. I have already hooked everything up, you just need to make it to the top of the tall red building, and connect some cables along the way.\n\nPlease do it... for me.\n\nI wanted to go out this way, don't blame yourself...",
            "m_MenuTextQuestName": "Note #2"
          }
        },
